### 1. Registrar usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "carlos",
  "password": "Carlos123"
}


### 2. Login correcto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "carlos",
  "password": "Carlos123"
}


### 3. Login incorrecto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "carlos",
  "password": "Incorrecta123"
}


### 4. Registro duplicado
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "carlos",
  "password": "Carlos123"
}


### 5. Usuario vacío
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "",
  "password": "Carlos123"
}


### 6. Contraseña corta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "usuario2",
  "password": "123"
}